OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker brings you
OL,7,     Fexclusive live performances,
OL,8,     Fincluding Schumann's Spring
OL,9,     FSymphony and Part 1 of his
OL,10,     Foratorio Paradise and the Peri,
OL,11,     Ffrom the Leipzig Gewandhaus.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Rameau
OL,13,     F1/5. Donald Macleod traces
OL,14,     FRameau's early years, including
OL,15,     Fhis search for the right job and a
OL,16,     Ftrip to Italy, although the
OL,17,     Fcomposer's early years remain
OL,18,     Flargely a mystery.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
